---
import Button from './Button.astro';
---
<section class="story-section" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="container story-grid">
    <div class="story-note"><span class="eyebrow">GOOD APOLLO GOODS</span><strong>one<br /><em>maker.</em></strong><span class="eyebrow">GRAND RAPIDS · MICHIGAN</span></div>
    <div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">About the studio</p><h2 id="story-title" class="display-heading">A design practice,<br />worked out <em>by hand.</em></h2><p>Good Apollo Goods is an independent, one-woman label shaped by a professional design background, vintage references, and traditional handcraft.</p><p>Each hat is developed with attention to proportion, construction, and the way natural fabrics soften with wear. Pieces are made in small batches, leaving room to notice the details.</p><Button href="/about/" variant="secondary" arrow>Meet the maker</Button></div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .story-section { background: var(--color-surface); padding-block: var(--space-section); }
  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); align-items: center; }
  .story-note { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; max-width: 480px; background: var(--color-brand); color: var(--color-page); border-radius: 48% 48% var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-8); text-align: center; padding: var(--space-8); transform: rotate(-1deg); }
  .story-note strong { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); font-weight: 480; line-height: .85; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .story-note em { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .story-copy h2 { margin-block: var(--space-5) var(--space-8); }
  .story-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 58ch; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-5); line-height: 1.8; }
  .story-copy :global(.button) { margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  @media(max-width: 800px) { .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .story-note { width: 100%; } }
</style>
